From {{inh|nl|dum|banghe}}, from {{m|dum|be-}} + {{m|dum|anghe}}. The latter word is an adverbial form of {{m|dum|enge||narrow, confined}}, compare {{m|nl|angst||fear}}. See also {{cog|gml|bange}}, {{cog|gmh|bange}}, {{cog|de|bang}}, {{cog|fy|bang}}.

